    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>http://localhost:52198/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:52198/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;My name is Matt Rogers. I&amp;rsquo;m a research software engineer, chaos remediation specialist, and aspiring polymath. I&amp;rsquo;ve worked with everyone from microbiologists to economists and linguists to facilitate research with custom software.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m most at home with interesting ETL pipelines, but I&amp;rsquo;ve built everything from websites and dashboards to custom image processing software.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Outside of work, I&amp;rsquo;m revising a novel, building and shooting&#xA;traditional bows, and pursuing a Sisyphean (though generally delicious) quest for the perfect eggplant&#xA;parm sub.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
